{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15102490","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15102490","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1510249001:0":{"text":"Herdmaster...","source_cn":"伟大的狩猎神。<key:dialog1>","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB9AE5872891D89DF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Herdmaster...","female":"Herdmaster...","variant_male_record_index":"178189","variant_female_record_index":"178190","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1510249002:0":{"text":"I hear Gala's been named your divine emissary. In that case, she won't be exiled from the Wildborn.","source_cn":"我听说加拉已经被指名为你的神使，那么，她不必被驱逐出雅...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xFE966613A1394116","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"I hear Gala's been named your divine emissary. In that case, she won't be exiled from the Wildborn.","female":"I hear Gala's been named your divine emissary. In that case, she won't be exiled from the Wildborn.","variant_male_record_index":"178191","variant_female_record_index":"178192","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1510249003:0":{"text":"Gala, you must be the voice of the Hunting God. Let none mistake his decree.","source_cn":"加拉，你要好好传达狩猎神的意思。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x847A159D2F54F40A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"Gala, you must be the voice of the Hunting God. Let none mistake his decree.","female":"Gala, you must be the voice of the Hunting Goddess. Let none mistake her decree.","variant_male_record_index":"178193","variant_female_record_index":"178194","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1510249004:1":{"text":"I understand.","source_cn":"好。<key:dialog4>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3640731D596444B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1510249005:0":{"text":"And the blessing ceremony? Will it be the same as before?","source_cn":"赐福仪式怎么办，和之前一样？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xDFEF4502E514D43C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"And the blessing ceremony? Will it be the same as before?","female":"And the blessing ceremony? Will it be the same as before?","variant_male_record_index":"178196","variant_female_record_index":"178197","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1510249005":{"text":"And the blessing ceremony? Will it be the same as before?","source_cn":"赐福仪式怎么办，和之前一样？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xDFEF4502E514D43C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"And the blessing ceremony? Will it be the same as before?","female":"And the blessing ceremony? Will it be the same as before?","variant_male_record_index":"178196","variant_female_record_index":"178197","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1510249006:0":{"text":"Then first we shall offer a sacrifice. Please judge us and give us your blessing.","source_cn":"那还是先献祭，再赐福。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x23878B4BEEEC94AE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Then first we shall offer a sacrifice. Please judge us and give us your blessing.","female":"Then first we shall offer a sacrifice. Please judge us and give us your blessing.","variant_male_record_index":"178198","variant_female_record_index":"178199","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1510249007:1":{"text":"Gala, did Modra tell you all the steps?","source_cn":"加拉，蒙多告诉你具体步骤了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x305D9F372C841EC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1510249008:1":{"text":"Yes, I have learned them.","source_cn":"加拉知道。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x959CC025117F6DA8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1510249009:1":{"text":"Modra has chosen the specific time to be in two days. We must prepare the live sacrifice.","source_cn":"蒙多挑选的日子在两天后，要准备好活祭。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51A23ED19517D29F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:12:1510249009":{"text":"Modra has chosen the specific time to be in two days. We must prepare the live sacrifice.","source_cn":"蒙多挑选的日子在两天后，要准备好活祭。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51A23ED19517D29F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1510249010:1":{"text":"The Divine One is not satisfied with the old ways.","source_cn":"狩猎神不满意既有方式。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9435AF3B3922FC08","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"The Divine One is not satisfied with the old ways.","female":"The Divine One is not satisfied with the old ways.","variant_male_record_index":"178203","variant_female_record_index":"178204","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1510249011:1":{"text":"Then take him to observe the preparations and meet his every need.","source_cn":"带狩猎神旁观筹备过程。满足<male>他</male>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x78ADDA78CC742883","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"Then take him to observe the preparations and meet his every need.","female":"Then take her to observe the preparations and meet her every need.","variant_male_record_index":"178205","variant_female_record_index":"178206","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1510249012:1":{"text":"Understood.","source_cn":"好。<key:dialog5>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x08587A5440B15D84","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1510249013:1":{"text":"Is that alright, Herdmaster...?","source_cn":"狩猎神大人……？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xAEC65EEDF1E9A794","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Is that alright, Herdmaster...?","female":"Is that alright, Herdmaster...?","variant_male_record_index":"178208","variant_female_record_index":"178209","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:17:1510249013":{"text":"Is that alright, Herdmaster...?","source_cn":"狩猎神大人……？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xAEC65EEDF1E9A794","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Is that alright, Herdmaster...?","female":"Is th